<title>ANTIGUA AND BARBUDA: CRICKET-LEEWARD ISLANDS V SRI LANKA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-LEEWARD ISLANDS V SRI LANKA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>final day of the three-day tour match between the Leeward</p>
<p>Islands and Sri Lanka on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 192-6 declared (R.Mahanama 65)</p>
<p>Leeward Islands first innings 148 (M.Muralitharan 4-34)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka second innings (overnight 213-1)</p>
<p> R.Mahanama lbw b Mills		    13</p>
<p> R.Arnold c Irish b Phillip	     158</p>
<p> M.Atapattu c Morton b Mills	    118</p>
<p> A.de Silva c Morton b Phillip	   80</p>
<p> H.Tillekeratne not out		    19</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-4 nb-2)		    10</p>
<p> Total (for four wickets, declared)   398</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 1-28 2-270 3-326 4-398</p>
<p>Bowling: Quinn 14-1-66-0, Mills 15-0-62-2, Phillip</p>
<p>47.5-8-127-2, Irish 16-4-55-0, Bass 19-1-80-0</p>
</text>
